WEBVTT

00:01:28.763 --> 00:01:31.930
The family is somebody
needing their diaper changed.

00:01:31.963 --> 00:01:34.963
The family is making sure
you're taking care of your mom.

00:01:34.997 --> 00:01:36.663
That's your family.

00:01:36.697 --> 00:01:37.897
This is your team.

00:01:38.497 --> 00:01:39.663
And we've also learned

00:01:39.697 --> 00:01:42.763
that that separation
between family and work

00:01:42.797 --> 00:01:45.197
has become this balancing act.

00:01:45.230 --> 00:01:47.330
And that when we used to say,

00:01:47.363 --> 00:01:50.463
"Well, this is my work home
and this is my family home,

00:01:50.463 --> 00:01:52.730
and those are two
completely different things,"

00:01:52.763 --> 00:01:55.797
for many of us, it's exactly
the same thing.

00:01:55.830 --> 00:01:58.297
You're no longer at home and at work.

00:01:58.330 --> 00:02:00.863
For many of us, work is at home
and the home is --